  "source_anchor": "arXiv:2609.06905v1, Section 2.2, equations (2.6)-(2.7)",
  "target_statement": "For a probability measure mu on any finite-dimensional real inner-product Borel space E and eta>0, the pushforward of mu.prod(stdGaussian E) by (x,z)->(x,x+sqrt(eta) z) equals (mu.prod volume).withDensity of ofReal(((sqrt(2*pi*eta))^-1)^finrank R E * exp(-norm(y-x)^2/(2*eta))). The density is relative to mu tensor volume, not volume tensor volume; the source-specific Gibbs substitution remains separate.",
